      "content": "Here's a template for a 'standard professional' response that's suitable for most customers, especially those who are likely to be well-educated and financially stable: \n\n\"Hello, thank you for reaching out to us about the status of your order. We're sorry to hear that it's experiencing a delay. Our team is working diligently to get your order to you as soon as possible, and we appreciate your patience and understanding. You can expect an update on the shipping status within the next 24-48 hours, and we'll be in touch with further instructions once your order is on its way.\"",
