      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right, some customers might appreciate a more casual tone. Here's a version that's a bit more relaxed and might resonate better with urban customers:\n\n\"Hey, we've got an update on your order. Unfortunately, it's running a bit behind schedule. We're working hard to get it to you ASAP, and we'll send you another update within the next 24-48 hours. Thanks for your patience, and we'll make sure it's worth the wait.\"\n\nThis version is a bit more conversational and uses a more informal greeting, which might help build a connection with urban customers.",
